muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862140/extras/2210eaac6dbac32799b070a31f825aea.poster.avif?t=1745353165\" width=690 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862140/extras/2210eaac6dbac32799b070a31f825aea.webm?t=1745353165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862140/extras/2210eaac6dbac32799b070a31f825aea.mp4?t=1745353165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862140/extras/8957c5f0529dd2e5ff1ced9b0e5f7bcf.webp?t=1745353165\" width=501 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up round-exclusive powerups mid-battle: torch rivals with Fire Breath, freeze them solid with Ice Ring, transform foes with Mushroom Ring, or protect yourself with Earth Shield. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862140/extras/662189e18220d5b33ecd41ad97355043.poster.avif?t=1745353165\" width=690 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862140/extras/662189e18220d5b33ecd41ad97355043.webm?t=1745353165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862140/extras/662189e18220d5b33ecd41ad97355043.mp4?t=1745353165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862140/extras/27a3a4e8f58f39de3c046215f6a6e4df.webp?t=1745353165\" width=501 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"